re excuse.) Tj0 -16.9293  TD -0.0076  Tc -0.4728  Tw (Reason may leave it behind.) Tj0 -16.8092  TD -0.0155  Tc -0.5249  Tw (Maybe far behind.) TjT* -0.0107  Tc -0.4397  Tw (And proceed to the result.) Tj0 -16.9293  TD -0.0158  Tc -0.3446  Tw (Our senses give us an experience.) Tj0 -16.8092  TD -0.007  Tc -0.5455  Tw (They wish to dictate a result.) TjETendstream
